### Mini ERP API Sample HTTP Requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login as Admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@minierp.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 3. Get Authenticated User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Dashboard Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Products List
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&per_page=15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Create Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PRD-TEST-100",
  "name": "Wireless Noise Cancelling Headphones",
  "category_id": 1,
  "unit_id": 1,
  "cost_price": 75.0,
  "sale_price": 129.0,
  "reorder_level": 5,
  "opening_stock": 20,
  "warehouse_id": 1
}

### 7. Inventory Stock Balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Low Stock Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Create Purchase Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-04",
  "remarks": "Urgent stock replenishment",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 10,
      "unit_price": 650.0
    }
  ]
}

### 10. Create and Approve Goods Receipt (GRN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/goods-receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "warehouse_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-04",
  "remarks": "Received in good condition",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 10,
      "unit_price": 650.0
    }
  ]
}

### 11. Create Sales Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-04",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unit_price": 899.0
    }
  ]
}

### 12. Create Delivery
POST {{baseUrl}}/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "warehouse_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-04",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unit_price": 899.0
    }
  ]
}

### 13. Create Sales Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-04",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unit_price": 899.0
    }
  ]
}

### 14. Record Money Receipt
POST {{baseUrl}}/money-receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-04",
  "payment_method": "bank",
  "deposit_account_id": 3,
  "amount": 1798.0,
  "reference_no": "TXN-9847291"
}

### 15. Trial Balance Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/trial-balance?as_of_date=2026-11-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Profit & Loss Statement
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/profit-loss?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Balance Sheet Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/balance-sheet?as_of_date=2026-11-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
